CVE-2026-16742

# Owner: Audicle maintainers. Recheck: 2026-10-10.
# Debian 13 has no fixed package version. Tinyproxy does not read or write ACLs,
# and the container has no capabilities or writable host mounts.
CVE-2026-54369

# Owner: Audicle maintainers. Recheck: 2026-10-10.
# Debian 13 has no fixed package version. The proxy does not accept terminal
# descriptions or invoke ncurses tools.
CVE-2025-69720

# Owner: Audicle maintainers. Recheck: 2026-10-10.
# Debian 13 has no fixed package versions. Tinyproxy does not invoke Perl,
